# The Vercel deploy carries the public demo surface only (VDE-62): api/index.py
# plus the stdlib-only modules it imports. Everything else in this repository is
# the platform — Postgres, dbt, Dagster, the MCP server — and has no business in
# a function bundle that is deliberately dependency-free (ADR-015).
*
!api
!api/**
!src
!src/agent
!src/agent/*.py
!vercel.json
